  "fuente": "https://ficcifestival.com/sites/default/files/2026-05/Catalogo_Oficial_FICCI_65.pdf#page=156"
 },
 {
  "work_id": "w_R4HAT4TMT7EK",
  "campo": "sinopsis.en",
  "valor": "The routine drama of a man, seen up close: the languor that envelops the ordinary and the sober cheerfulness that adorns it. A rarefied air seems to emanate from the sleeping bodies, prolonging effort, gestures, and silence; behind that opaque atmosphere, the possibility of contact emerges. A hybrid short.",
